# Most tournaments use time controls with either an (preference)

Standing user preference: Most tournaments use time controls with either an increment (time added before or after each move) or a delay (a countdown before the clock restarts).

## Conventions
- Most tournaments use time controls with either an increment (time added before or after each move) or a delay (a countdown before the clock restarts).

